msgid "Every link in it carries utm_source=eventcrew, utm_medium=email and utm_campaign=thanks-YYYY-MM-DD or missed-YYYY-MM-DD, so your shop’s and your site’s statistics can tell which sales came from these emails. The Roster page shows how many people opened a link."
